{
  "scenario": "Condensate export pump P-2001A at the fictional Nordvik gas terminal. The export system's two pump functions (duty P-2001A and standby P-2001B) are implemented by physical pumps, serial numbers 48213 and 48214, installed in process module 20. The installed pump has assembled parts, a duplex stainless steel casing and rated and measured quantities with their units on its datasheet. Its installation, timed by start and end events, is followed by a mechanical seal replacement whose performance test realises the pumping function.",
